<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Order confirmation</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>Hello {{customer_name}}!</p>
<p>Thank you for your order!</p>
<p>Your order number is: <strong>{{order_id}}</strong>.</p>
<p>Order date: {{order_date}}</p>
<p>Total amount: {{total_amount}}</p>
<h3>Order details:</h3>
<ul>
  {{#each orderItems}}
    <li>
      {{this.product_name}}
      {{#if this.isDelivery}}
      {{else}}
        x{{this.quantity}}
      {{/if}}
      - {{this.price}}
    </li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>
<p>We will let you know when your order is ready to ship!</p>
<p>Kind regards,<br>The Zielony Koszyk team</p>
</body>
</html>
